          'Connects every stage — from lead to job to invoice',
          'No manual hand-offs between steps',
        ],
        ctaLabel: 'Book a Call',
      },
      {
        name: 'Custom AI Development',
        features: [
          'Built around your exact business, not a template',
          "Solves the specific problem nobody else has solved for you",
          'Scoped and mapped out on your strategy call',
        ],
        ctaLabel: 'Book a Call',
      },
      {
        name: 'Business Intelligence Dashboards',
        features: [
          "Real-time insight into what's actually working",
          'No more digging through spreadsheets',
          'One dashboard for the metrics that matter',
        ],
        ctaLabel: 'Book a Call',
      },
    ]}
  />

  <PricingFaq />

  <FinalCta
    eyebrow="Ready to Get Started?"
    headline="Which Service Does Your Business Need First?"
    subheadline="Book a free strategy call and we'll map out exactly what to start with — and what to add later."
  />

  <BookCall />

  <Footer
    slot="footer"
    logoText="ScaleKit"
    tagline="Not a bundle of connected tools. One team that builds, ranks, and grows your business, start to finish."
    contactEmail="hello@scalekit.io"
    groups={footerGroups}
  />
</BaseLayout>
